BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:616
DTSTAMP:20261117T063810Z
SUMMARY:Genealogy Drop-In
URL;VALUE=URI:https://escondido.librarycalendar.com/event/genealogy-drop-61
 6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260822T174847Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260822T174847Z
DESCRIPTION:Discover your family history with the help of our knowledgeable
  genealogy volunteers. Whether you're a beginner or have been researching 
 for years\, our experts are here to assist you. Drop in anytime between 10
 :00 AM and 12:00 PM to:\n\n- Get Personalized Assistance: Receive one-on-o
 ne help from genealogy enthusiasts.\n- Learn Tips and Tricks: Discover eff
 ective strategies for tracing your ancestors.\n- Use Powerful Tools: Get g
 uidance on using Ancestry.com Library Edition and FamilySearch to enhance 
 your research.\n\nJoin us at the Pioneer Room and uncover the stories of y
 our past. No appointment necessary. Bring your questions\, your curiosity\
 , and any information you already have about your family tree.\n\nCheck ou
 t the Pioneer Room's Genealogy Page for more information!
CATEGORIES:History & Culture,Games & Hobbies,Tech & Digital Skills
CONTACT:Ashley Hays\, pioneer.room@escondidolibrary.org\, 7608394315
DTSTART:20261120T180000Z
DTEND:20261120T220000Z
LOCATION:247 S Kalmia St\, Escondido\, CA\, 92025\, US
IMAGE;ALTREP="Genealogy Drop-In Logo and Text. Text reads, ^'Genealogy drop
 -in at the Pioneer Room archive.^'";DISPLAY=FULLSIZE;VALUE=URI:https://esc
 ondido.librarycalendar.com/sites/default/files/2026-08/PR%20logo%20%28gene
 alogy%29%20%282%29.png
END:VEVENT
